9,"h":18,"s":8,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"8:24","t":"O you who have believed, respond to Allāh and to the Messenger when he calls you to that which gives you life. And know that Allāh intervenes between a man and his heart and that to Him you will be gathered.","j":9,"h":18,"s":8,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"8:25","t":"And fear a trial which will not strike those who have wronged among you exclusively, and know that Allāh is severe in penalty.","j":9,"h":18,"s":8,"a":25,"sd":null}],"juz":9,"hizb":18,"surahs":[8],"sajdah":false}